Package: easyanalysis
Title: Summary Tables and Normality Checks for Research Reporting
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Mukul", "Maheshwari", email = "noreply@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helper functions for building "Table 1"-style descriptive and
    comparison summary tables (via gtsummary and flextable) and for checking
    normality of continuous variables (via the Shapiro-Wilk test), aimed at
    clinical/research manuscript reporting.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    broom,
    dplyr,
    flextable,
    formattable,
    gtsummary,
    Hmisc,
    stats,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.1.4)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
